  "title": "Document editors can alter permissions via the documents update API",
  "summary": "### Summary\r\n  A user who is granted `change_document` permission and `edit` permission in a document can change the document's `owner` field.\r\n\r\n### Details\r\n\r\nDocumentSerializer exposes a writable owner field. When a user has change_document on a shared document, DocumentViewSet permits the update and the serializer does not restrict ownership changes to owners/admins.",
